  <p class="form-status"
     tal:condition="view.status"
     tal:content="view.status">Status</p>

  <span tal:condition="not 'fromGLogin' in view.request.form">
  <div class="form-error"
       tal:condition="view.errors">
    <ul tal:condition="view.formErrors"
        tal:repeat="error view.formErrors">
      <li> <span tal:replace="error.title" /> </li>
    </ul>
    </span>
    <h3>One Last Question</h3
<p> Because of my work, I get to personally know a
number of very senior developers, data scientists, and the interesting work
that they are doing.  I really enjoy making matches between the people  and
the jobs that would interest them. But to do that for you, 
I need your GDPR permission.  If you would be
kind enough to check one or both of the following two boxes,
I woudl be most grateful.  </p>

<p>If you have any questions, please
<a href="/contact">contact me</a>. I love getting phone calls.
</p>

<form action="." tal:attributes="action view.action_url;
                                 id view.htmlId();
                                 method view.formMethod;
                                 enctype view.enctype"
	  tal:define="widgets view.widgetDictionary()"
	  >

<textarea style="display:none;" id="form-field-idtoken" name="form.field.idtoken"  >${view.request.form["form.field.idtoken"]}</textarea>

    <input id="form-field-chatPermission-present"
    name="form.field.chatPermission.present"
    class="field form-control form-control form-control form-control form-control form-control form-control form-control"  checked="checked" value="True" type="hidden" required="required" />

    <p> I give permission to process my professional information for the following purposes:</p>


<div class="form-check "
   tal:define="widget widgets['form-field-recruitPermission']">
   
<input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input "
id="form-field-recruitPermission" name="form.field.recruitPermission"
value="${widget.value['form.field.recruitPermission']}"  />

<label class="form-check-label " for="form-field-recruitPermission">
To help me get a better job.</label>
<div tal:condition="view.fieldWidgets"  >
       <p class="field-error"
	 tal:define="error view.fieldWidgets['form.field.recruitPermission'].error"
	 tal:condition="error"
	 tal:content="error.title" />
	 </div>
</div>


<div class="form-check "
   tal:define="widget widgets['form-field-hirePermission']">
   
<input type="checkbox" class="form-check-input "
id="form-field-hirePermission" name="form.field.hirePermission"
value="${widget.value['form.field.hirePermission']}"  />

<label class="form-check-label " for="form-field-hirePermission">
To help me hire a good developer.</label>
<div tal:condition="view.fieldWidgets"  >
       <p class="field-error"
	 tal:define="error view.fieldWidgets['form.field.hirePermission'].error"
	 tal:condition="error"
	 tal:content="error.title" />
	 </div>
</div>

<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary"
    id="form-action-add" name="form.action.add" value="Add"
    >Submit</button>
</form>
